section: ghc-lib
synopsis: The GHCi evaluation API now returns ``Id``\s and ``TyThing``\s rather than ``Name``\s
issues: #28052
mrs: !16883

description: {
The results of interactive evaluation are now returned directly, rather than as
``Name``\s that had to be looked up again in the interactive context:

- ``ExecComplete``'s ``execResult`` and ``ExecBreak``'s ``breakNames`` now hold ``[Id]``.
- ``runDecls``, ``runDeclsWithLocation`` and ``runParsedDecls`` now return ``[TyThing]`` rather than ``[Name]``.
- ``rttiEnvironment`` now returns a Subst with the inferred types.

The returned ``Id``\s carry the types refined by runtime type inference.
}
